    <h1 data-split data-split-delay="120">How we work</h1>
    <p class="lede">ARIES combines qualitative and quantitative approaches so that
    insights reflect real conditions rather than theoretical assumptions, building, over time, a sustainable research culture of continuous inquiry,
    critical thinking, and data-driven decision-making.</p>
